      "known": "Former pro StarCraft player",
      "bio": "One of the most famous StarCraft players of the 2000s, known as \"YellOw\" and for finishing second so often that the number 2 became his joke. He finally won first place on The Genius season 1 and became the genre's most familiar face, returning to The Genius twice and to The Bloody Game twice."
    },
